<title>USA: ADC Telecommunications Inc Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>ADC Telecommunications Inc Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MINNEAPOLIS 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter Ended	     Year Ended</p>
<p>		    October 31,		October 31,</p>
<p>		   1996     1995	  1996	1995</p>
<p> Net Sales   $255,052 $173,652     $828,009  $586,222</p>
<p>Operating</p>
<p>   Income	45,433   26,151	133,184    80,324</p>
<p> Net Income    28,079   18,657	 87,463    55,186</p>
<p>Earnings</p>
<p>  Per Share	 .22	.15	    .68	 .47</p>
<p>Note: Per share amounts have been restated to reflect a two-for-one stock split effected in the form of a 100 percent stock dividend paid on October 31, 1996.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
